{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2018-05", "window": 2, "start_date": 1525737600, "end_date": 1526428799, "month_true_total": 401, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:08:24 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "42058446", "author": {"steamid": "76561198117548979", "personaname": "Whiskey Delta", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SaleMeObama/", "num_games_owned": 400, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 9034, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5007, "last_played": 1736224754, "avatar": "fc5d8974fd3b0cd4519d382edd70e89172d6da5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "So out of the how many ever hours I have in the game, majority comes from the editor. It is possibly the most creative, wartime sandbox out there. Whether it's strafing civilians in a town with an A-10, or bombarding a set enemy patrol with artillery, anything is possible. All things are possible from within the editor, and the easy to use workshop makes it all that much better. \n\nNow when it comes to the other players, these people are some dedicated individuals. You have military call signs in King of the Hill, and some seriously good players. Just flying in a helicopter with people that can hover through a city street just wide enough for the heli at 200 mph is enough to get you going. Also makes you fell like youre a crap player who cant hit a broad side of a barn with a hydra missle strafe.\n\n10/10 will crash heli into hospital again.", "timestamp_created": 1526426252, "timestamp_updated": 1526426252, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.503816783428192139", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42058126", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020783113", "per